    unit: 'ns',
    maxVal: 5000,
    methodology:
      'Measures serializing the canonical 11-field PeerUpdate message (nested Location submessage, 4 Neighbor submessages, packed uint32 prefixes, string tags, and 64-bit counters) into a Uint8Array. OmniBuf writes in a single forward pass with 2-byte length backpatching and an inline UTF-8 fast path.',
    rows: [
      {
